1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,593
The Evil Mirror.
Look in, and your evil twin
steps out.

2
00:00:05,633 --> 00:00:07,333
Why would you want that?

3
00:00:07,373 --> 00:00:10,954
Twice the genius.
Twice the evil!

4
00:00:11,663 --> 00:00:14,833
Good morning!
I paid the rent. Early.

5
00:00:14,873 --> 00:00:17,563
You did WHAT?
Back in the mirror!

6
00:00:17,603 --> 00:00:20,703
Of course!
I'll take the rent money back.

7
00:00:20,743 --> 00:00:24,637
Cleo, you look.
Show me real evil.

8
00:00:25,923 --> 00:00:26,743
No.

9
00:00:26,783 --> 00:00:29,393
That's exactly what
Cleo would say!

10
00:00:29,433 --> 00:00:30,653
We know.

11
00:00:30,693 --> 00:00:33,147
One of you,
back in the mirror.

12
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:36,540
Finally. Normal.

13
00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:38,030
Normal.
